window.docContents[234].resolve({"/Calculational-proofs/#Kernel-Hom___-Tactics-for-Kernel-Categorical-Reasoning--Calculational-proofs--String-diagrams-of-the-calculation--Second-calculation":{"contents":"Step 1. Arrangement of the kernels so that the sufficiency equation appears.\n\n\n\nStep 2. By sufficiency.\n\n\n\nStep 3. Composition of a and α, so that the completeness applies. The string diagrams of both sides are the same.\n\n\n\nStep 4. By completeness, with the first calculation.\n\n\n\nStep 5. The factorization of Theorem 15.8.\n\n\n\nStep 6. By ancillarity.\n\n\n\n","context":"Kernel-Hom: Tactics for Kernel Categorical Reasoning\u0009Calculational proofs\u0009String diagrams of the calculation","header":"2.2.2. Second calculation","id":"/Calculational-proofs/#Kernel-Hom___-Tactics-for-Kernel-Categorical-Reasoning--Calculational-proofs--String-diagrams-of-the-calculation--Second-calculation"}});